reference.api:
```
GET    /v1/cart                                 → {lines[], version, totals}
POST   /v1/cart/items      {sku, qty}           → adds qty (idempotent via request id)
PUT    /v1/cart/items/{sku} {qty, if_version}   → set qty
DELETE /v1/cart/items/{sku}
POST   /v1/cart/merge      {guest_cart_id}      → called on login
POST   /v1/checkout/validate                    → {lines, price_changes[], unavailable[]}
```
- Identity is the user id when signed in, otherwise a `cart_id` cookie.
- Mutations carry a request id so a retried tap is not applied twice.
